<title>USA: Simon DeBartolo picked for Phila. project.</title>
<headline>Simon DeBartolo picked for Phila. project.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia officials said they selected Simon DeBartolo Group Inc to develop Penns' Landing on the Delaware River.</p>
<p>The $130 million project will include at least 20 movie screens, retail stores and restaurants. A restaurant by entertainment mogul Steven Spielberg could also be part of the project.</p>
<p>Financing for the project will come mostly from Simon DeBartolo, with the city contributing about $30 million for parking and other infrastructure.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
